    "detailed_description": "Multi-functional live wallpaper tool to set diverse wallpapers on your desktop! <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Interactive professional web wallpapers: unlimited creativity! </h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Support the latest web front-end technology framework, support local HTML networking</li><li> Freely use the third-party front-end development toolchain you are familiar with for web wallpaper production</li><li>Through the built-in API interface, the web wallpaper can interact with the local operating system:<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Directly call in HTML to open local applications, system power on, adjust volume, etc.</li><li>Directly obtain operating system resource information, such as CPU, RAM usage, The current system volume, network traffic information, real-time audio spectrum, etc.</li></ul></li><li>Through the above interfaces and HTML animations, animations, events, and deep integration, you can make functional web wallpapers, such as application storage bars integrated with wallpaper UI, system resource display, real-time audio spectrum, etc.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> multi-screen and zoom support</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> support multi-screen, DPI Zoom</li><li>Set the same or different wallpapers for each screen individually</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share &amp; download</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Share your wallpapers with built-in tools</li><li>Browse and download your favorite wallpapers with built-in tools</li></ul>",
